  m_text: "Player1 Flap:\n\u2022 X (PS) / A (Xbox)\nPlayer1 Drop:\n\u2022 R1 (PS)
    / RB (Xbox)\n\n\n\nOn Offense: \n\u2022 Grab the football to start an offensive
    drive\n\u2022 Ball Carrier tries to reach or drop the ball through the field
    goal\n\u2022 Blocker stays ahead, clearing a path through Cyclone birds\n\u2022
    Players switch roles after each offensive drive\n\u2022 Players from helmets
    are safe from collisions\n"
